--------CONSTRUCTOR----------

Constructor is a special type of method.
It is a set of instruction like a a Method and Block used for  initialize of NON STATIC  variable and instantiation.

RULE : Constructor name must be same as ClassName.

you can accept parameters in the constructor, but its  optional.
constructor will execute once an object is created.
Constructor doesnot have any return type, not even void.

TYPES :
1 Default Constructor
2 Custom Non Parameterized Constructor.
3 Custom Parameterized Constructor.
